``` T1110.001 - Password guessing correlated across workstation (4625) and domain controller (4771)
    The same burst on BOTH sources in the same window is much stronger evidence than either alone.
    4771 has a single Account_Name; 4625 has two, so mvindex(...,1) takes the target.
    lower() makes the account names from both sources comparable. ```
index=endpoint ((EventCode=4625 host=SOC-WIN10*) OR (EventCode=4771 host=SOC-DC01*))
| eval target=lower(if(EventCode=4625, mvindex(Account_Name,1), Account_Name))
| search target!="*$"
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count(eval(EventCode=4625)) as ws_failures count(eval(EventCode=4771)) as dc_failures values(host) as hosts by _time, target
| where ws_failures>=5 AND dc_failures>=5
